    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Seer Council",
    "summary": "As round one starts, roll D6s to build a Fate Dice pool. Roll three for Incursion, six for Strike Force or nine for Onslaught. Keep the results. When you use a listed Stratagem, you can discard one Fate Die showing its assigned face and cut the cost by 1CP. The faces in ascending order are Presentiment of Dread, Forewarned, Unshrouded Truth, Fate Inescapable, Isha’s Fury and Psychic Shield.",
